      "title": "The Haçienda",
      "description": "Former nightclub in Manchester, England",
      "extract": "The Haçienda was a nightclub and music venue in Manchester, England, which became famous during the Madchester years of the 1980s and early 1990s. It was run by the record label Factory Records.",
